ass)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/dd817ebb46f8d1d09c59d90ee077f3b6.poster.avif?t=1751175974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/dd817ebb46f8d1d09c59d90ee077f3b6.webm?t=1751175974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/dd817ebb46f8d1d09c59d90ee077f3b6.mp4?t=1751175974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure sensitive hits. Softer and harder hits are detected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add drums, cymbals, cowbells, splashes, china. Position them where you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comes stock with all the goodies most drummers want. 7 snare drums, 5 bass drums, also an amped bass drum, 7+ crash cymbals, 2 ride cymbals, 3 splash cymbals, tom drums 6&quot;, 8&quot;, 10&quot;, 12&quot;, 14&quot; with multiple tom drum heads for different sounds. A roto tom rack 6&quot;, 8&quot;, 10&quot; roto toms, 4 different hi-hats (rock, 50's and metal trash), china cymbals, dry crash, a custom china stack, mounted tambourine, steelpan, xylophone and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the position of the default drum kit and load it back-in next time you play. Unlimited.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Over 90 drumming sounds and pitch effects to make more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tenor drumming mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller haptic force feedback. (Option to enable)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attention gone into creating realistic looking drums, cymbals, textures and realistic finishes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play drum charts (.chart files) created by you or others (Example: Moonscraper Chart Editor, Feedback Chart Editor, or even .chart Clone Hero charts) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR GrabCam. Grab the camera, place it anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic instrumental sounds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liv.tv support for custom VR avatars or advanced VR green screen setups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple hardware Hi-hats. Close it, strike it open or closed, hear the changes. Use your VR controllers or connect a physical USB foot pedal or gamepad device. Use it like a real hi-hat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/524516ebcdb09a238cf3b028574cef88.poster.avif?t=1751175974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/524516ebcdb09a238cf3b028574cef88.webm?t=1751175974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/524516ebcdb09a238cf3b028574cef88.mp4?t=1751175974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Technical Information</strong><br>Will VR Drums Ultimate Streamer work with my VR headset?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The app is programmed to track headsets and devices that support OpenXR and has been tested on multiple PC's and different devices. Please see below for devices that are compatible with XR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/85f80dd93344ca0a61a1c1a7c4cdccdd.avif?t=1751175974\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ud83d\udfe2